  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">厌倦了千篇一律的不死图腾？用这个简单的资源包为你的生存之旅来个&nbsp;<em>完美</em>的转折，将图腾替换为<strong>互联网上最棒的梗猫</strong> 😼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每次你从死亡边缘逃脱，这不仅仅是一个图腾&mdash;那是<strong>梗猫的魔法</strong>将你带回人间</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✨ 功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将不死图腾替换为互联网最受欢迎的梗猫的高质量材质贴图</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1266/740/screenshot-2025-07-25-232103.png\" alt=\"手持不死图腾\" width=\"528\" height=\"556\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手持、背包及激活时均可正常显示</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全兼容 Minecraft 1.11 至最新版本</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">轻量级，不影响游戏性能</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>📦 仅为资源包&ndash;无需安装模组！(搭配</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-person-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">第一人称模型 Forge/Fabric 效果更佳，但非必需）</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">单独使用或与其他梗图主题资源包搭配效果极佳。安装它，装备你的图腾，让猫咪梗图真正地拯救你的生命吧&mdash;字面意义上的！</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的其他项目：</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spongecraft-gui-jellyfish-krabby-patty-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1313684/description_c78c0a86-a479-406a-857f-8c0a152c019a.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"163\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pochacco-hotbar-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">帕恰狗的趣味GUI</a></h1>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pochacco-hotbar-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1313684/description_c1f7ee54-cdaf-4e09-84f9-725f2b1ddddc.png\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
